// PC = 0 (Word 0)
// Lower 16-bits (PC=0): c.nop (Hex: 0001)
// Upper 16-bits (PC=2): Lower half of "addi x1, x0, 5" (Hex: 0093)
00930001

// PC = 4 (Word 1)
// Lower 16-bits (PC=4): Upper half of "addi x1, x0, 5" (Hex: 0050)
// Upper 16-bits (PC=6): c.li x2, 10 (Hex: 4129) -> Load 10 into x2
41290050

// PC = 8 (Word 2)
// Standard 32-bit instruction to catch the results
// add x3, x1, x2 (Hex: 002081b3) -> 5 + 10 = 15
002081b3